## Context strategy (save tokens)

1. **Use Graphify first** — `graphify query "..."` / `graphify path "A" "B"` before reading multiple source files.
2. **After code edits** — run `graphify update .` (AST-only, no API cost).
3. **Scope reads** — open only files returned by graphify query; avoid whole-repo grep unless graph is missing.
4. **Skip** — `node_modules/`, `graphify-out/cache/`, `india-locations.json`, lock files, assets (see `.cursorignore`).

## PujaSetu map (compact)

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| API | `backend/src/` — Express, MongoDB |
| Mobile | `mobile/src/` — Expo, Redux, screens |
| Auth | OTP + JWT — `backend/src/controllers/authController.js` |
| Bookings | 15% advance, OTP unlocks 85% — `bookingController.js` |
| Providers | Custom pricing — `providerController.js` `updatePricing` |
| Docker | `backend/docker-compose.yml` |

## Do not load unless needed

- Full `graphify-out/graph.json` (use `graphify query` instead)
- `README.md` unless onboarding/deploy question
- Entire `mobile/node_modules` or `backend/node_modules`
